    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d544">

                <pb facs="0819" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg705"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">511.4R1/70: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Observer at Bangkok</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-11-12T18:00:00+07:00">November 12, 1931—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 12—9:55 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>My November 12, 10 a.m.<anchor n="37" xml:id="d544-f1"/> Statement was made on
                    invitation of President who stated that all delegates having made statements,
                    Conference would welcome statement of American observer regarding experience in
                    enforcing prohibition. I made a brief introduction referring especially to
                    evidence contained in statement of each delegate that there is very great
                    illicit traffic under all systems. President expressed thanks for clear and
                    frank statement. So far no hostile criticism, some expressions of approval of
                    this definite statement of our position.</p>
                <p>Illicit traffic is being discussed in private session and statement made there
                    cannot be given to press.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caldwell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d544-f1" n="37" xml:id="d544-f1-content">
                <p>It read, “Statement made.” The statement Is printed <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >supra.</hi></p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
